{
  "_comment": "前端纯逻辑模块的类型检查（docs/26 F1/§3.2-2）：JSDoc + checkJs 拿 ~80% TS 价值、零构建。单独开文件的原因：主 tsconfig 开 checkJs 会波及 scripts/*.mjs。",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "target": "ES2023",
    "module": "ESNext",
    "moduleResolution": "bundler",
    "allowJs": true,
    "checkJs": true,
    "strict": true,
    "noEmit": true,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "forceConsistentCasingInFileNames": true,
    "lib": ["ES2023", "DOM", "DOM.Iterable"],
    "types": ["node"]
  },
  "include": ["src/web/public/app/**/*.js"]
}
